# Docs, ADRs, and Security/Integrity

- Review ADRs and guides before major changes:
  - [ADR: Choose Next.js](mdc:docs/adr/0001-nextjs.md)
  - [ADR: Choose Supabase](mdc:docs/adr/0002-supabase.md)
  - [ADR: Gemini API](mdc:docs/adr/0003-gemini-api.md)
