  - [Coding Standards](mdc:docs/06-development/coding-standards.md)
  - [Styling Guide](mdc:docs/05-components/styling-guide.md)
- Security & Integrity (from Coding Standards):
  - Enforce RLS and least privilege in Supabase.
  - Keep service keys server-only.
  - Immutability: comments/history immutable; no hard deletes for domain records.
  - Use soft-delete fields for attachments and user deactivation.
